r}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL可推导公式在 GL 中有证明</li>\n<li>GL可推导公式是 GL 的定理</li>\n<li>GL可推导性是 GL 的核心概念</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"68e33d1af76a6bfa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"68e33d1af76a6bfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}$ is the predicate on\n$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ from\n[[89-df-gl-derivation]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}derivable}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{Der}_{G\\!L}(\\pi,A)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":704,"backlinks":[{"id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-derivable]])."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-di